Package: freightdataus
Title: Interregional Freight Flow Data for the United States
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mizuki", "Uchida", , "uchidamizuki@vivaldi.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides US freight flow data from the Commodity Flow Survey
    (CFS) Public Use File for 2012, 2017, and 2022: shipment records,
    weighted origin-destination flows by commodity and mode, zones, and
    distances between zones. The data are built on demand from files
    published by the US Census Bureau using the 'tarchives' and 'targets'
    packages, and are returned in the same format for every survey year.
